> ### 1. The Titan Relic Seed
> 
> On the central altar is the **glowing red crystal heart** (or a bracer/amulet set with that crystal).
> 
> You can present 2–3 options:
> 
> > “The pirates are already stuffing coins into their bags. On the altar, the glowing red crystal pulses like a heartbeat.  
> > Do you:
> > 1. Smash it,
> > 2. Take it,
> > 3. Or ignore it and grab regular treasure?”
> 
> Whatever he does gives story juice, but I’d suggest:
> 
> - If he **takes it**:
>   - It becomes his **Titan Relic seed**:  
>     - For now: just flavor, maybe once
